  "recent_examples": [
    {
      "id": "20261015-t.huff85y7dlym-B058-0",
      "speaker_id": "05",
      "gender": "男",
      "text": "不过台积电这个例子倒挺适合拿来对照昨晚的课程。企业盈利是一回事，股票现在值不值得买，还得结合价格和市场预期判断。",
      "source_label": "05男：",
      "source_tab_id": "t.huff85y7dlym",
      "source_offset": 4245,
      "source_revision": "AHj4eMRTCSigGAgbf0WSOia21RhxplsCSc6mog_hthRQdmOOsL_XQFu5615dotNZGzNSjDlmV8Do-MrWlawzqIxPjg9aGOnXgpw0XiC0e4Q",
      "date": "2026-10-15",
      "node": "AFTERNOON",
      "kind": "message",
      "status": "PRESENT_IN_FORMAL_DOCUMENT",
      "unlabelled_fragment": false,
      "warnings": [],
      "fictional_only": true,
      "real_trade_not_inferred": true
    },
    {
      "id": "20261015-t.huff85y7dlym-B064-0",
      "speaker_id": "05",
      "gender": "男",
      "text": "这倒不一定。不过你们注意到没有，有些银行股票交易业务表现不错，其他业务却不怎么样。",
      "source_label": "05男：",
      "source_tab_id": "t.huff85y7dlym",
      "source_offset": 4781,
      "source_revision": "AHj4eMRTCSigGAgbf0WSOia21RhxplsCSc6mog_hthRQdmOOsL_XQFu5615dotNZGzNSjDlmV8Do-MrWlawzqIxPjg9aGOnXgpw0XiC0e4Q",
      "date": "2026-10-15",
      "node": "AFTERNOON",
      "kind": "message",
      "status": "PRESENT_IN_FORMAL_DOCUMENT",
      "unlabelled_fragment": false,
      "warnings": [],
      "fictional_only": true,
      "real_trade_not_inferred": true
    },
    {
      "id": "20261015-t.huff85y7dlym-B077-0",
      "speaker_id": "05",
      "gender": "男",
      "text": "我觉得不能一看到价格有变化，就急着做决定，还是得先看清楚再说。",
      "source_label": "05男：",
      "source_tab_id": "t.huff85y7dlym",
      "source_offset": 5626,
      "source_revision": "AHj4eMRTCSigGAgbf0WSOia21RhxplsCSc6mog_hthRQdmOOsL_XQFu5615dotNZGzNSjDlmV8Do-MrWlawzqIxPjg9aGOnXgpw0XiC0e4Q",
      "date": "2026-10-15",
      "node": "EVENING",
      "kind": "message",
      "status": "PRESENT_IN_FORMAL_DOCUMENT",
      "unlabelled_fragment": false,
      "warnings": [],
      "fictional_only": true,
      "real_trade_not_inferred": true
    },
    {
      "id": "20261015-t.huff85y7dlym-B098-0",
      "speaker_id": "05",
      "gender": "男",
      "text": "这确实不好区分。",
      "source_label": "05男：",
      "source_tab_id": "t.huff85y7dlym",
      "source_offset": 7372,
      "source_revision": "AHj4eMRTCSigGAgbf0WSOia21RhxplsCSc6mog_hthRQdmOOsL_XQFu5615dotNZGzNSjDlmV8Do-MrWlawzqIxPjg9aGOnXgpw0XiC0e4Q",
      "date": "2026-10-15",
      "node": "EVENING",
      "kind": "message",
      "status": "PRESENT_IN_FORMAL_DOCUMENT",
      "unlabelled_fragment": false,
      "warnings": [],
      "fictional_only": true,
      "real_trade_not_inferred": true
    },
    {
      "id": "20261016-t.gbfri5r8vs3o-B005-0",
      "speaker_id": "05",
      "gender": "男",
      "text": "到底是哪些行业把指数带起来的。如果主要靠其他板块上涨，那和科技股真正恢复强势还是两回事。",
      "source_label": "05男：",
      "source_tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o",
      "source_offset": 434,
      "source_revision": "AHj4eMRTCSigGAgbf0WSOia21RhxplsCSc6mog_hthRQdmOOsL_XQFu5615dotNZGzNSjDlmV8Do-MrWlawzqIxPjg9aGOnXgpw0XiC0e4Q",
      "date": "2026-10-16",
      "node": "MORNING",
      "kind": "message",
      "status": "PRESENT_IN_FORMAL_DOCUMENT",
      "unlabelled_fragment": false,
      "warnings": [],
      "fictional_only": true,
      "real_trade_not_inferred": true
    },
    {
      "id": "20261016-t.gbfri5r8vs3o-B013-0",
      "speaker_id": "05",
      "gender": "男",
      "text": "我也是。昨天政治方面的消息让市场挺活跃的，今天想看看这种情绪有没有延续。尤其是BET指数里的大公司，表现应该比较有代表性。",
      "source_label": "05男：",
      "source_tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o",
      "source_offset": 976,
      "source_revision": "AHj4eMRTCSigGAgbf0WSOia21RhxplsCSc6mog_hthRQdmOOsL_XQFu5615dotNZGzNSjDlmV8Do-MrWlawzqIxPjg9aGOnXgpw0XiC0e4Q",
      "date": "2026-10-16",
      "node": "MORNING",
      "kind": "message",
      "status": "PRESENT_IN_FORMAL_DOCUMENT",
      "unlabelled_fragment": false,
      "warnings": [],
      "fictional_only": true,
      "real_trade_not_inferred": true
    },
    {
      "id": "20261016-t.gbfri5r8vs3o-B018-0",
      "speaker_id": "05",
      "gender": "男",
      "text": "我刚查了一下，是做工业钻探服务的。平时看银行和能源股比较多，这类公司接触得少。",
      "source_label": "05男：",
      "source_tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o",
      "source_offset": 1566,
      "source_revision": "AHj4eMRTCSigGAgbf0WSOia21RhxplsCSc6mog_hthRQdmOOsL_XQFu5615dotNZGzNSjDlmV8Do-MrWlawzqIxPjg9aGOnXgpw0XiC0e4Q",
      "date": "2026-10-16",
      "node": "MORNING",
      "kind": "message",
      "status": "PRESENT_IN_FORMAL_DOCUMENT",
      "unlabelled_fragment": false,
      "warnings": [],
      "fictional_only": true,
      "real_trade_not_inferred": true
    },
    {
      "id": "20261016-t.gbfri5r8vs3o-B023-0",
      "speaker_id": "05",
      "gender": "男",
      "text": "原来你已经持有了啊。那你之前的买入价是多少？如果已经有仓位，再买和第一次买还是有区别的。",
      "source_label": "05男：",
      "source_tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o",
      "source_offset": 1761,
      "source_revision": "AHj4eMRTCSigGAgbf0WSOia21RhxplsCSc6mog_hthRQdmOOsL_XQFu5615dotNZGzNSjDlmV8Do-MrWlawzqIxPjg9aGOnXgpw0XiC0e4Q",
      "date": "2026-10-16",
      "node": "MORNING",
      "kind": "message",
      "status": "PRESENT_IN_FORMAL_DOCUMENT",
      "unlabelled_fragment": false,
      "warnings": [],
      "fictional_only": true,
      "real_trade_not_inferred": true
    },
    {
      "id": "20261016-t.gbfri5r8vs3o-B038-0",
      "speaker_id": "05",
      "gender": "男",
      "text": "昨天是科技公司的债务问题，今天又开始反弹了。到底是哪些公司的表现带动了这波回升，不能把整个科技板块混在一起。",
      "source_label": "05男",
      "source_tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o",
      "source_offset": 2931,
      "source_revision": "AHj4eMRTCSigGAgbf0WSOia21RhxplsCSc6mog_hthRQdmOOsL_XQFu5615dotNZGzNSjDlmV8Do-MrWlawzqIxPjg9aGOnXgpw0XiC0e4Q",
      "date": "2026-10-16",
      "node": "AFTERNOON",
      "kind": "message",
      "status": "PRESENT_IN_FORMAL_DOCUMENT",
      "unlabelled_fragment": false,
      "warnings": [],
      "fictional_only": true,
      "real_trade_not_inferred": true
    },
    {
      "id": "20261016-t.gbfri5r8vs3o-B052-0",
      "speaker_id": "05",
      "gender": "男",
      "text": "这下能看出一些区别了。特斯拉涨得不错，但芯片和AI基础设施公司还在承压，确实不能把科技股当成一个整体。",
      "source_label": "05男：",
      "source_tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o",
      "source_offset": 3784,
      "source_revision": "AHj4eMRTCSigGAgbf0WSOia21RhxplsCSc6mog_hthRQdmOOsL_XQFu5615dotNZGzNSjDlmV8Do-MrWlawzqIxPjg9aGOnXgpw0XiC0e4Q",
      "date": "2026-10-16",
      "node": "AFTERNOON",
      "kind": "message",
      "status": "PRESENT_IN_FORMAL_DOCUMENT",
      "unlabelled_fragment": false,
      "warnings": [],
      "fictional_only": true,
      "real_trade_not_inferred": true
    },
    {
      "id": "20261016-t.gbfri5r8vs3o-B060-0",
      "speaker_id": "05",
      "gender": "男",
      "text": "我也选A，不过有点犹豫。特斯拉盘前不错，半导体却还在承压，今晚纳指内部可能也会分化。",
      "source_label": "05男：",
      "source_tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o",
      "source_offset": 4241,
      "source_revision": "AHj4eMRTCSigGAgbf0WSOia21RhxplsCSc6mog_hthRQdmOOsL_XQFu5615dotNZGzNSjDlmV8Do-MrWlawzqIxPjg9aGOnXgpw0XiC0e4Q",
      "date": "2026-10-16",
      "node": "AFTERNOON",
      "kind": "message",
      "status": "PRESENT_IN_FORMAL_DOCUMENT",
      "unlabelled_fragment": false,
      "warnings": [],
      "fictional_only": true,
      "real_trade_not_inferred": true
    },
    {
      "id": "20261016-t.gbfri5r8vs3o-B097-0",
      "speaker_id": "05",
      "gender": "男",
      "text": "那我有个疑问。如果柱状图开始缩短，但股票价格还在上涨，是不是说明价格和动能已经出现不同的变化了？",
      "source_label": "05男：",
